# ============================================================
# Rizline-Score — files that should NOT be uploaded to GitHub
# ============================================================
# What IS uploaded (intentionally not ignored):
#   Riz_bundle.py, rizline_login.py, rizb40_tool.js, index.html
#   songs.json, mapping.json, layout.json, all_cache.json
#   achievement*.json, bio*.json   (small data files the tool loads)
# Everything below is either huge, regenerated by Riz_bundle.py,
# downloaded game assets, or personal/sensitive data.

# ---- Downloaded game assets (~1.9 GB, re-downloadable) ----
# Fetched by `Riz_bundle.py --download` from the Rizline CDN.
/download/
*.bundle
*.acb

# ---- Generated output (~1.6 GB, regenerated by Riz_bundle.py) ----
# output/charts/, output/illust/, output/illust_HiRes/, output/default.json
/output/

# ---- Generated cache (deleted & recreated on every export) ----
# Per-song *_col.txt / *_notes.txt written by the level-table export.
/charts_info/
/chart_info/

# ---- Generated reports (derived from output/charts) ----
/Database.txt
/output.txt
*_rks_report.json

# ---- Personal / sensitive data (NEVER commit) ----
# rizline_login.py writes your decrypted save as <player>_gameData.json
# It contains userId, username, mails, purchases, etc.
*_gameData.json
*gameData*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*credential*.json
*secret*.json
*token*.json

# ---- Stray nested repo (empty clone that only contains .git) ----
/Rizline-Score/

# ---- Large binary font (8.4 MB) ----
# index.html falls back to sans-serif without it. If you publish via
# GitHub Pages and want the exact font, delete this line and commit the .ttf.
*.ttf

# ---- Backups, logs & temp files ----
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
*.swp
*~

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ---- Node (rizb40_tool.js is plain browser JS, just in case) ----
node_modules/

# ---- OS & editors ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
